<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY FOUR.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY FOUR.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the fourth day of the Hopman Cup mixed teams tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>3-South Africa beat 2-Switzerland 2-1</p>
<p>Singles (South African names first):</p>
<p>Amanda Coetzer lost to Martina Hingis 1-6 2-6</p>
<p>Wayne Ferreira beat Marc Rosset 0-6 1-2 (retired)</p>
<p>Doubles:</p>
<p>Ferreira/Coetzer beat Rosset/Hingis (forfeit)</p>
</text>
